        "sphinx-build -b linkcheck -W",
        "default retry count",
        "Retry-After handling",
        "strict failure semantics"
      ],
      "retention_rule": "Retain the setting only if both the exact-candidate PR and exact-main strict checks complete within 120 seconds and have at most one rate-limit wait each. If the PR result misses the target, do not merge the experiment. If only the post-merge main result misses, revert through the normal PR workflow."
